WEBVTT

00:01.033 --> 00:07.033
Did October 7 shake your trust in the people of Gaza?

00:08.266 --> 00:09.900
Yes of course.

00:15.200 --> 00:19.133
I'm not in the left side of the political map of Israel,

00:19.133 --> 00:20.266
I'm in the middle.

00:20.700 --> 00:25.766
My wife was a member of the Knesset two years,

00:25.766 --> 00:28.266
three years, ago four years ago.

00:28.900 --> 00:32.933
we right in the middle of the political.

00:33.233 --> 00:35.433
And we want to live in peace.

00:35.433 --> 00:36.900
We want to live peacefully.

00:36.900 --> 00:41.333
I told you there will be no peace in my generation,

00:41.533 --> 00:43.833
but we want to live peacefully,

00:44.233 --> 00:48.000
and I thought the things that we are doing,

00:48.266 --> 00:53.066
the things that we are talking about them all the time,

00:54.600 --> 01:00.633
would get into the mind of the majority of people in

01:01.500 --> 01:02.566
in Gaza.

01:03.666 --> 01:08.333
And when I saw all the pictures, that civilians,

01:08.333 --> 01:10.866
not Nukhba, not the soldiers,

01:10.866 --> 01:13.833
but the civilians coming to

01:13.833 --> 01:16.533
kibbutzim and taking things from them...

01:16.566 --> 01:19.533
and I heard from the soldiers,

01:19.533 --> 01:23.000
that there are people (in Gaza) who are hiding

01:25.100 --> 01:28.533
hostages and parts of bodies

01:28.533 --> 01:30.133
in the in the refrigerator.

01:30.300 --> 01:32.133
Of course it's disappointing.

01:32.433 --> 01:33.866
Very disappointing.

01:34.500 --> 01:36.966
I thought that we can talk.

01:36.966 --> 01:39.166
Now I know that in this situation,

01:39.166 --> 01:42.233
we can not talk. And I want to talk with them.

01:43.166 --> 01:45.066
I want to live good here.

01:45.066 --> 01:49.066
I don't care about them but I know that,

01:49.566 --> 01:51.233
as I told you before,

01:51.233 --> 01:53.000
if I want to live good here,

01:53.133 --> 01:55.033
they have to live good over there.

01:56.733 --> 01:59.833
And it's far away now.

01:59.833 --> 02:03.466
It will take a long time after October 7th,

02:03.466 --> 02:05.800
it will take much more time.
